    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="It drills into a single case action" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Drill into and Add a Single Case Action</p>
            <p>Opens the Case Actions tab for a live case, adds a new case action with generated target date, and verifies navigation to the Edit Action page.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>1) Navigate to the Actions → Case Actions tab. 2) Click "Add Client Action". 3) Select an action category and status. 4) Enter a target date (faker-generated). 5) Save and navigate into the newly added case action.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The new case action is created and the Edit Action page is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
        <procedure title="Differentiates `Save` vs `Save & Close` in Live Transaction" id="test-2">
